 139	- Download the latest Neutralinojs framework resources with the `--latest` option in the `neu update` command.
 140	- If framework versions are not present in the app/template configuration, download the latest framework resources automatically. The CLI will download nightly releases if it can't fetch the latest release tag because of an GitHub API-related issue (i.e., Exceeded rate limits).
